msgid ""
"Converting a pointer to generic (64 bits) using synthetic apertures is done "
"as follows:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:2112
msgid ""
"The value of the source pointer (32 bits) becomes the lower 32 bits of the "
"generic pointer."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:2114
