msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:2768
msgid "llvm.amdgcn.s.buffer.load"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:2769
msgid ""
"Deprecated. Takes its buffer resource as a `<4 x i32>`. Use "
"`llvm.amdgcn.ptr.s.buffer.load`, which takes a `ptr addrspace(8)` produced "
"by `llvm.amdgcn.make.buffer.rsrc`. The implicit assumptions encoded by the "
"fact that this intrinsic was tagged as not reading memory are replaced by "
"needing to tag `llvm.amdgcn.ptr.s.buffer.load` with `!invariant.load` "
"metadata."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:2775
msgid "llvm.amdgcn.{raw|struct}.\\*buffer.\\*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:2776
msgid ""
"Deprecated. The `buffer`, `tbuffer` and `atomic.buffer.load` intrinsics that "
"take their buffer resource as a `<4 x i32>` are replaced by the variants "
"with `ptr` inserted after the `raw` or `struct` component of the name, which "
"take a `ptr addrspace(8)` produced by `llvm.amdgcn.make.buffer.rsrc`."
msgstr ""

