"by the `r600` and `amdgcn` architectures (see {ref}`amdgpu-processor-"
"table`). The specific processor is specified in the `NT_AMD_HSA_ISA_VERSION` "
"note record for code object V2 (see {ref}`amdgpu-note-records-v2`) and in "
"the `EF_AMDGPU_MACH` bit field of the `e_flags` for code object V3 and above "
"(see {ref}`amdgpu-elf-header-e_flags-table-v3`, {ref}`amdgpu-elf-header-"
"e_flags-table-v4-v5` and {ref}`amdgpu-elf-header-e_flags-table-v6-onwards`)."
