#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:8255
msgid ""
"The order of the VGPR registers is defined, but the compiler can specify "
"which ones are actually setup in the kernel descriptor using the "
"`enable_vgpr*` bit fields (see {ref}`amdgpu-amdhsa-kernel-descriptor`). The "
"register numbers used for enabled registers are dense starting at VGPR0: the "
"first enabled register is VGPR0, the next enabled register is VGPR1 etc.; "
"disabled registers do not have a VGPR number."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:8262
