"wider sync scope. (Note that seq_cst fences have their own `s_wait_dscnt "
"0x0` and so do not need to be considered.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:14217
msgid ""
"`s_wait_loadcnt 0x0`, `s_wait_samplecnt 0x0` and `s_wait_bvhcnt 0x0` must "
"happen after preceding global/generic load atomic/ atomicrmw-with-return-"
"value with memory ordering of seq_cst and with equal or wider sync scope. "
"(Note that seq_cst fences have their own waits and so do not need to be "
"considered.)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:14219 ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:14242
#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:14269 ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:15676
