msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:17264
msgid "An instruction has the following [syntax](AMDGPUInstructionSyntax.md):"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:17266
msgid ""
"`<`*opcode*`> <`*operand0*`>, <`*operand1*`>,... <`*modifier0*`> "
"<`*modifier1*`>...`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:17268
msgid ""
"[Operands](AMDGPUOperandSyntax.md) are comma-separated while [modifiers]"
"(AMDGPUModifierSyntax.md) are space-separated."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:17271
msgid ""
"The order of operands and modifiers is fixed. Most modifiers are optional "
"and may be omitted."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:17274
msgid ""
"For more information about instructions, their semantics and supported "
"combinations of operands, refer to one of instruction set architecture "
"manuals [{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX6 <amd-gcn-gfx6>`], [{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX7 <amd-gcn-"
"gfx7>`], [{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX8 <amd-gcn-gfx8>`], [{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX900-GFX904-"
"VEGA <amd-gcn-gfx900-gfx904-vega>`], [{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX906-VEGA7NM <amd-gcn-"
"gfx906-vega7nm>`], [{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX908-CDNA1 <amd-gcn-gfx908-cdna1>`], "
"[{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX90A-CDNA2 <amd-gcn-gfx90a-cdna2>`], [{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX942-"
"CDNA3 <amd-gcn-gfx942-cdna3>`], [{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX10-RDNA1 <amd-gcn-gfx10-"
"rdna1>`], [{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX10-RDNA2 <amd-gcn-gfx10-rdna2>`], [{ref}`AMD-GCN-"
"GFX11-RDNA3 <amd-gcn-gfx11-rdna3>`], [{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX11-RDNA3.5 <amd-gcn-"
"gfx11-rdna3-5>`] and [{ref}`AMD-GCN-GFX12-RDNA4 <amd-gcn-gfx12-rdna4>`]."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../AMDGPUUsage.md:17282
